-season-cdc-subclade-k-vaccination-11952f89201d2396ec0c52461441c82b\n* https://www.nbcnews.com/health/health-news/flu-shot-fail-why-doesn-t-vaccine-always-work-n21446\n* https://abc7.com/post/flu-vaccines-didnt-work-us-officials-find/18714030/\n* https://www.10tv.com/article/syndication/associatedpress/flu-vaccines-didnt-work-that-well-in-the-us-officials-find/616-9bae1666-91ed-45ed-8762-cdf85e8d0b15\n* https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6330882/\n* 16% effective https://ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/search/research-news/15706/\n* https://abc7ny.com/post/flu-vaccines-didnt-work-us-officials-find/18714030/\n", "author": "5DchessWatch", "created": 1791536646244, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "SvbHvman", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Yesterday I visited a friend in the hospital and in the elevator with 4 women, one was carrying 2 bags she said were Flu Shots.  She was acting like she's a missionary handing out antibiotics to lepers in ancient Italy.  It was GROSS", "last_comment_created": 1791539857830, "content": "<p>She was chatting it up with the nurses and they were treating her like a messiah and she was acting like one.</p>\n<p>I was immediately repelled by this</p>\n<p>I know the flu shot not only doesn't work, its actually something that increases flu</p>\n<p>WE ALL KNOW THIS.  I've read this and heard this from others countless times.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>The years I did NOT get flu shot I did NOT get flu.  The years I did receive the flu shot, I got sick.  Its almost as if the flu shot is giving me the flu!</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I've heard something like the above over and over for a decade or more.</p>\n<p>They keep pushing flu shot and acting like it works.  NIH article says it was 16% effective.  Meaning its so low that I wouldn't even call that effective.</p>\n<hr />\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/flu-season-cdc-subclade-k-vaccination-11952f89201d2396ec0c52461441c82b\" target=\"_blank\">https://apnews.com/article/flu-season-cdc-subclade-k-vaccination-11952f89201d2396ec0c52461441c82b</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/health/health-news/flu-shot-fail-why-doesn-t-vaccine-always-work-n21446\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.nbcnews.com/health/health-news/flu-shot-fail-why-doesn-t-vaccine-always-work-n21446</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://abc7.com/post/flu-vaccines-didnt-work-us-officials-find/18714030/\" target=\"_blank\">https://abc7.com/post/flu-vaccines-didnt-work-us-officials-find/18714030/</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.10tv.com/article/syndication/associatedpress/flu-vaccines-didnt-work-that-well-in-the-us-officials-find/616-9bae1666-91ed-45ed-8762-cdf85e8d0b15\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.10tv.com/article/syndication/associatedpress/flu-vaccines-didnt-work-that-well-in-the-us-officials-find/616-9bae1666-91ed-45ed-8762-cdf85e8d0b15</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6330882/\" target=\"_blank\">https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6330882/</a></li>\n<li>16% effective <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/search/research-news/15706/\" target=\"_blank\">https://ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/search/research-news/15706/</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://abc7ny.com/post/flu-vaccines-didnt-work-us-officials-find/18714030/\" target=\"_blank\">https://abc7ny.com/post/flu-vaccines-didnt-work-us-officials-find/18714030/</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 36, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awar